Local portability changes: disable OS-thread Atomics on __3DS__; use the custom
allocator supplied by the Snow Storm host rather than an unavailable malloc_usable_size.
No quickjs-libc module, file access, process execution or network APIs are exposed.

Switch/Vita: the same Atomics and default-allocator portability guards also
apply to __SWITCH__ and __vita__. Keep -fwrapv -fno-strict-aliasing when compiling
the engine. The portable Snow host supplies the bounded allocator.
